# Lint and format only what is staged, then run the whole test suite.
#
# The linters run here rather than only in CI because .github/workflows/deploy.yml
# is a single job -- build, test, lint, then deploy. A lint failure there is a
# failed deploy of the live site, not a failed check on a pull request. Prettier
# is set to --write rather than --check so a formatting nit fixes itself and gets
# restaged instead of blocking the commit.
npx lint-staged
npm test
